<title>HONG KONG: Reuters 3rd ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 3rd ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Current average ex-Hong Kong air cargo market rates in Hong Kong dollars per kg for a 100kg shipment, with volume-to-weight of six to one.</p>
<p>				 NOV 15	    OCT 17</p>
<p>				 EUROPE</p>
<p>HK-LHR			 24.30	   22.25</p>
<p>HK-FRA			 24.50	   22.40</p>
<p>				 USA</p>
<p>HK-JFK			 24.60	   20.70</p>
<p>HK-LAX			 25.31	  21.05</p>
<p>				 MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>HK-DXB			 15.90	   15.80</p>
<p>				 ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>HK-SIN			  9.20	    9.10</p>
<p>HK-TAIPEI		     4.60	    4.10</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
